  154: --     so a call carrying ONLY the original five names still resolves against this function. There is
  155: --     still exactly ONE `complete_signup` in the catalog, so the drop-first reasoning above is
  156: --     untouched â€” a default is not an overload.
  157: --   * THE NEW EDGE FUNCTION OMITS the four github keys from the rpc body when the judged handle is
