  162: -- first, old edge: the old edge cannot supply a handle, so this function refuses with the stated
  163: -- GitHub-link reason â€” fail-closed, and the old schema could not have stored the profile anyway.
  164: -- New edge, old migration: the nine-key call does not resolve and the caller sees a resolution
